patch type="fixed" "Releasing an audio session requirement, or the audio engine stopping, now always removes the requirement, even when deactivating or reconfiguring the audio session fails. A failed deactivation no longer keeps the session active for good or makes the next engine start skip activating the session. Since LiveKitWebRTC 150.7871.08 the audio device module only logs a failed teardown hook, so the engine has stopped either way"
